{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50147","headline":"送友人向恬（括）[一]（原卷作「括」。）州（斯二七一七） · 李适","name":"送友人向恬（括）[一]（原卷作「括」。）州（斯二七一七）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"委迤吴山云，演漾洞庭水。\n青枫既愁人，白频（苹）亦靡靡。\n送君出京国，孤舟眇江泛。\n（「江泛」，蒋云当作「江汜」。\n）浮阳怨芳岁，况乃别行子。\n括苍涨海壖，斯路天台[□]。\n我有岩中念，遥寄四明里。\n（[一]刘云：「『恬』乃『括』之误，今浙江丽水，唐避德宗讳改处州。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}